---
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
Full-text index for the search box on the Blog page (assets/js/blog-search.js): one entry per
post with its title, date, description, tags, categories and plain text (including the Korean
summary). Fetched only when a visitor starts typing in the box.
{%- endcomment -%}
[
{%- for post in site.posts %}
  {
    "title": {{ post.title | jsonify }},
    "url": {{ post.url | relative_url | jsonify }},
    "date": {{ post.date | date: "%B %-d, %Y" | jsonify }},
    "description": {{ post.description | jsonify }},
    "tags": {{ post.tags | join: " " | replace: "-", " " | jsonify }},
    "categories": {{ post.categories | join: " " | replace: "-", " " | jsonify }},
    "text": {{ post.content | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }}
  }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
{%- endfor %}
]
